{{- /*
  Per-machine secrets / env.
  Rendered by `chezmoi apply`. Lives at ~/.zsh/99-local.zsh.
  Permissions: 0600 (private_ prefix).

  Add 1Password references like:
    export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY="{{`{{ onepasswordRead "op://Personal/Anthropic/credential" }}`}}"

  They're commented out by default — uncomment as you actually need them, so
  failed lookups don't break a fresh `chezmoi apply`.
*/ -}}

